Error [jet.UnknownName]: `bump` needs the script's `count`, which isn't bound here
  --> tests/ui/script_function_called_from_a_test_without_its_variable.jet:11:5
    |
 11 |     bump()
    |     ^^^^
  --> tests/ui/script_function_called_from_a_test_without_its_variable.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | count := 0
    | ^^^^^ `count` is set here
 Why: `bump` uses `count`, and only the script's own lines pass it by themselves
 Fix: Pass it by name: `bump(…, count: …)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
